1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 15=

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,119
Hua.

6
00:00:13,839 --> 00:00:15,160
You're finally home.

7
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:16,879
Come here.

8
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,039
Look what I made.

9
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:19,399
All your favorites.

10
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:29,239
Working out there

11
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,519
must be so hard.

12
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:31,839
You've lost weight.

13
00:00:33,159 --> 00:00:34,240
Let me get you some soup.

14
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,079
Congrats on your master's, Hua.

15
00:00:41,399 --> 00:00:43,880
And you even landed a job
at the prestigious S&D Group.

16
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:45,479
That's amazing.

17
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:46,880
Our Hua's all grown up

18
00:00:47,479 --> 00:00:48,359
and doing so well.

19
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,640
At the engagement party,

20
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:58,560
you knew Hua was allergic to mango.

21
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:00,320
But you let them

22
00:01:00,479 --> 00:01:02,079
push mango cake on her.

23
00:01:03,159 --> 00:01:03,600
Gu Zheng,

24
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:06,280
you owe Hua an apology.

25
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:13,640
Hua,

26
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:14,599
I...

27
00:01:14,719 --> 00:01:15,400
It's okay.

28
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:16,840
It's in the past.

29
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:18,239
Mr. and Mrs. Gu,

30
00:01:18,519 --> 00:01:19,079
let's eat.

31
00:01:20,439 --> 00:01:20,799
Yes.

32
00:01:21,359 --> 00:01:22,519
Let's not dwell on that.

33
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,239
- Let's eat.
- Come on.

34
00:01:23,319 --> 00:01:24,000
- Eat up.
- Here.

35
00:01:42,159 --> 00:01:42,599
You...

36
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,159
I want to talk.

37
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,640
I have nothing to say to you.

38
00:01:48,439 --> 00:01:49,000
Go back.

39
00:01:49,439 --> 00:01:50,840
Your fiancee might get the wrong idea.

40
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,239
What wrong idea?

41
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:54,799
That we're having an affair?

42
00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:56,480
Or that you like me?

43
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,120
Exactly what you're thinking.

44
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:01,799
I remember

45
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:03,760
you'd beg me to chat before bed.

46
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:09,599
Gu Zheng, do you think

47
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,520
it's fun to toy with me like this?

48
00:02:13,159 --> 00:02:14,120
I'm not toying with you.

49
00:02:14,719 --> 00:02:16,000
I just want the old us back.

50
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,879
Gu Zheng, you're so childish.

51
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:19,759
Please leave.

52
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,159
Keep bothering me,

53
00:02:22,319 --> 00:02:23,680
and I'll never set foot here again.

54
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:25,639
Hua.

55
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:29,479
Gu Zheng,

56
00:02:30,599 --> 00:02:31,240
I know.

57
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:34,319
You want to be Gu Group's chairman.

58
00:02:34,599 --> 00:02:35,960
You want to be feared and respected.

59
00:02:36,439 --> 00:02:37,800
I understand. I do.

60
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,800
Your talent matches your ambition.

61
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:42,840
I wish you all the success in the world.

62
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:45,159
But please, leave me alone.

63
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,520
Stop bothering me.

64
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:48,439
Hua,

65
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,000
only you truly understand me.

66
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,560
- You're my soulmate.
- Gu Zheng.

67
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,039
Gu Zheng!

68
00:02:52,039 --> 00:02:53,080
- Let go of me!
- Let's get back together.

69
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:54,000
Let go of me!

70
00:02:54,479 --> 00:02:55,800
Gu Zheng, let go!

71
00:02:56,159 --> 00:02:57,360
Calm down.

72
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:59,159
Calm down!

73
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:10,640
(Jiang A74983)

74
00:03:19,039 --> 00:03:19,719
Hello, Zhouhan.

75
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:21,879
I'm at your gate.

76
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,879
You made such a big production
of coming here

77
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:34,360
just to ask about Lin Hua and me?

78
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,280
Tell me.

79
00:03:38,759 --> 00:03:39,639
We're legally married.

80
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,199
I'm serious.

81
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:43,919
What do you see in her?

82
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,919
So many rich heiresses in Jiangbei,

83
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:49,199
and you pick an orphan

84
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:51,120
with ties to the Gu heir?

85
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,439
Xie Jingshu.

86
00:03:52,759 --> 00:03:53,479
She's my wife

87
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,479
and your sister-in-law.

88
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,159
Show her some respect.

89
00:03:59,759 --> 00:04:00,879
I just don't understand.

90
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,120
Grandma set you up with all those girls,

91
00:04:03,479 --> 00:04:04,439
and you weren't interested.

92
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,439
But you fell for her.

93
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,000
You know,

94
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:20,920
in the Xie family,

95
00:04:22,519 --> 00:04:23,680
I've always been an outsider.

96
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:29,160
They abandoned me at ten

97
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,360
and sent me to Africa at fifteen.

98
00:04:32,959 --> 00:04:33,680
When I was a kid,

99
00:04:34,199 --> 00:04:35,439
they said I brought my family bad luck.

100
00:04:38,279 --> 00:04:39,800
I've lived like an orphan for years.

101
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:43,199
That's just old-fashioned superstition.

102
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:44,759
Don't let it get to you.

103
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:46,360
That's why I don't believe in fate.

104
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,279
But I believe in Lin Hua.

105
00:04:49,959 --> 00:04:50,920
She and Mrs. Su

106
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:55,240
were the only people

107
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,439
who ever made my childhood feel warm.

108
00:04:58,360 --> 00:05:03,000
(Twenty Years Ago)

109
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:09,759
(Zhouhan,)

110
00:05:11,639 --> 00:05:13,120
(don't sit by yourself all the time.)

111
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:14,639
(Look,)

112
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:16,560
(I'll have a baby soon.)

113
00:05:17,199 --> 00:05:17,959
(When she's here,)

114
00:05:18,399 --> 00:05:20,040
(she can play with you. Okay?)

115
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,920
(We'll be together from now on.)

116
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:36,639
(Come here, Zhouhan.)

117
00:05:37,439 --> 00:05:37,879
(Look.)

118
00:05:37,959 --> 00:05:38,639
Back then,

119
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,519
I kept everyone out.

120
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,120
(Is it fun?)

121
00:05:43,319 --> 00:05:44,800
Mrs. Su reached out to me.

122
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,079
And that tiny little life

123
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,879
gave me someone to care about,

124
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:52,680
someone

125
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:56,240
I couldn't stop wanting to protect.

126
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,000
♪You say you♪

127
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,840
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

128
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:19,240
♪You're just fine on your own♪

129
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:22,400
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

130
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:25,400
♪And the pain you face at night♪

131
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:29,080
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

132
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:32,280
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

133
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:35,360
♪Some love needs no promises♪

134
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:38,720
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

135
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:41,400
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

136
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:44,720
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

137
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:47,560
♪I'm right behind you♪

138
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:51,120
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

139
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:53,760
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

140
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:57,720
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

141
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:04,040
♪I'm right behind you♪

142
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,840
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

143
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,680
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

144
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:10,240
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

145
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,680
♪I'm right behind you♪

146
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:14,040
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

147
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,800
♪I won't claim you♪

148
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,480
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

149
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:20,120
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

150
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:23,480
♪Waiting for you♪
